{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15114190","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15114190","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1511418001:":{"text":"Stop struggling.","source_cn":"放弃挣扎吧","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC10CBF7FB5C7C83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1511418002:":{"text":"Don't try to deceive us!","source_cn":"别想蛊惑我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57A7D1E5D70F5A4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1511418003:":{"text":"Nazrik... and Gorgonna?!","source_cn":"那非和……露？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x615038B79330B841","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Nazrik... and Gorgonna?!","female":"Nazrik... and Gorgonna?!","variant_male_record_index":"190953","variant_female_record_index":"190954","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1511420001:":{"text":"What's going on?!","source_cn":"怎么回事？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xECEBD5C8CB078A2C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What's going on?!","female":"What's going on?!","variant_male_record_index":"191000","variant_female_record_index":"191001","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1511420002:":{"text":"Who's there?!","source_cn":"谁在说话？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2A126E771F47FE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1511420003:":{"text":"Nazrik, watch out!","source_cn":"那非小心！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x85D97B86F3D8C28C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Nazrik, watch out!","female":"Nazrik, watch out!","variant_male_record_index":"191002","variant_female_record_index":"191003","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1511419001:0":{"text":"Your heart lurches. Why are Nazrik and Gorgonna in Lanao's dream? And why is there such hostility between them?","source_cn":"眼前的景象令你震惊不已：为什么兰奥的梦中会出现那非和露...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3DD2565641754893","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Your heart lurches. Why are Nazrik and Gorgonna in Lanao's dream? And why is there such hostility between them?","female":"Your heart lurches. Why are Nazrik and Gorgonna in Lanao's dream? And why is there such hostility between them?","variant_male_record_index":"190955","variant_female_record_index":"190956","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511419002:0":{"text":"In your memories, Nazrik never once mentioned facing Gorgonna directly. And Gorgonna, avatar of the Hunting Goddess, why would she send warriors against him?","source_cn":"在你的记忆里，那非从未提过他曾与露正面对峙。更何况露是...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x76193D9C7C6CC297","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"In your memories, Nazrik never once mentioned facing Gorgonna directly. And Gorgonna, avatar of the Hunting Goddess, why would she send warriors against him?","female":"In your memories, Nazrik never once mentioned facing Gorgonna directly. And Gorgonna, avatar of the Hunting Goddess, why would she send warriors against him?","variant_male_record_index":"190957","variant_female_record_index":"190958","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511419003:0":{"text":"You remind yourself it's only a dream.","source_cn":"你又一次想起这里是梦境，于是强压震惊，接受了眼前这怪异...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x75C830AE21E00BD2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You remind yourself it's only a dream.","female":"You remind yourself it's only a dream.","variant_male_record_index":"190959","variant_female_record_index":"190960","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511419004:1":{"text":"Still, the strangeness forces you to stay hidden, watching.","source_cn":"不过你依然不清楚兰奥为什么会梦到那非和露，所以决定暂时...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD3D2BCC618D02ED2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Still, the strangeness forces you to stay hidden, watching.","female":"Still, the strangeness forces you to stay hidden, watching.","variant_male_record_index":"190961","variant_female_record_index":"190962","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511419005:0":{"text":"Ames, how's Tase?!","source_cn":"阿米，泰泽情况怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x911982D36710ECFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1511419006:0":{"text":"I... I can't save him...","source_cn":"不……我、我救不了他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD135CD14B1FDF5B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1511419007:0":{"text":"Damn it!","source_cn":"可恶……！<key:dialog153>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99BB1F348991B32F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511419008:1":{"text":"Gorgonna! Why are you after us?!","source_cn":"——露！你为什么一直针对我们？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C6487D69E42C7D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1511419009:0":{"text":"Us? You've got it all wrong.","source_cn":"你们？哈哈，我想你搞错了什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43507BCA4346D647","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1511419010:0":{"text":"I'm not targeting all of you—only you, my cute little lamb.","source_cn":"我针对的不是你们，而是你~只有你——可爱的小羊羔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA017FAA6581EA5E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1511419011:0":{"text":"<shk>Why?!</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>为什么？！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F28E7261B05AF32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1511419012:0":{"text":"Ah, didn't I tell you? <style=\"highlight\">You must die here.</style>","source_cn":"啊，我不是告诉过你了吗？<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x591673ABB5FA2DF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1511419013:0":{"text":"Since you refuse to obey me, I have no choice but to use force.","source_cn":"你不肯听从我，那我也只能使用一些暴力手段了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06C1469E2BCD01C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1511419014:0":{"text":"If your target is me, why kill Tase?!","source_cn":"既然你的目标是我，为什么要杀泰泽？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD209F75CD5B7064","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1511419015:0":{"text":"Little lamb... why waste pity on the weak?","source_cn":"小羊羔，何必这么在乎一个废物呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE50D3CC5A0898494","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1511419016:0":{"text":"The <style=\"highlight\">Bloodhunt Festival</style> is a cruel game. Only one can claim victory—or perhaps none. He was doomed to die; I merely hastened his return to the goddess you worship.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>猎血节</style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x966509FA92BE78D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1511419017:0":{"text":"Nonsense!","source_cn":"一派胡言！<key:dialog5>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x990044872AD5EEF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1511419018:0":{"text":"If you hadn't manipulated Tase, the three of us could have won the Bloodhunt Festival together!","source_cn":"要不是你蛊惑泰泽，我会带领他们三个人一起赢得猎血节！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A1FDBDE26949E25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1511419019:0":{"text":"Ah, how naive you are.","source_cn":"哎呀，你还真是天真呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3BB5510F4249C3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1511419020:0":{"text":"Haven't you realized? <style=\"highlight\">The Bloodhunt Festival is all about slaughtering each other.</style> The Hunting Goddess revels in blood soaking the land...","source_cn":"难道你还没有看清，<style=highlight>猎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x183ABDE4E3472694","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1511419021:1":{"text":"Silence! Do not blaspheme the Wild Moon!","source_cn":"——闭嘴！不许污蔑雅库伯尔之月！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54E3F34E0E134F28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1511419022:0":{"text":"Heh... loyal, but oh so blind.","source_cn":"呵呵，真是忠诚又愚蠢的信徒呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x199CE61DBBF6B66F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1511419023:0":{"text":"Tell me—your noble goddess commands the hunt, yet why do the forest beasts grow fiercer, more plentiful with every festival?","source_cn":"仔细想想我说的话吧：崇高的神命令你们狩猎，可为什么丛林...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC29BCCE7AD804171","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1511419024:0":{"text":"The Wildborn have held the Bloodhunt Festival countless times... so why is there never a true victor? And those fallen warriors—where do you think they've gone?","source_cn":"雅库伯尔举行了那么多次猎血节，为什么不是每一次都有胜者...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8E386CA293DEF77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1511419025:0":{"text":"Shut your mouth...","source_cn":"你住嘴……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8DD965A523FD616","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1511419026:0":{"text":"To win the Bloodhunt Festival, you must kill everyone. Even your friends.","source_cn":"所以说啊，你想要成为猎血节的胜者，就必须把所有人都杀掉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29541B2BFE3A3EE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1511419027:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1511419028:0":{"text":"A hush falls. You realize this dream must be from Nazrik's youth, during the <style=\"highlight\">Bloodhunt Festival</style>—the Wildborns' cruelest rite.","source_cn":"突如其来的沉默给了你短暂思考的机会。很显然，这场梦境源...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCCB6B7AFFD9B959A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"A hush falls. You realize this dream must be from Nazrik's youth, during the <style=\"highlight\">Bloodhunt Festival</style>—the Wildborns' cruelest rite.","female":"A hush falls. You realize this dream must be from Nazrik's youth, during the <style=\"highlight\">Bloodhunt Festival</style>—the Wildborns' cruelest rite.","variant_male_record_index":"190985","variant_female_record_index":"190986","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1511419029:1":{"text":"But why is Gorgonna, the Hunting Goddess' divine emissary, here? And why does she openly reveal the truth of the festival?","source_cn":"可是，露作为狩猎神的化身，为什么会出现在这里？还如此坦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9760F846810F05B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1511419030:1":{"text":"Her tone and demeanor are completely different from what you witnessed at the Primal Shrine. Is she really Gorgonna?","source_cn":"她的口吻和语气，也和你在狩猎神殿中的所见完全不同。她真...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF60591FAE37A5CA7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Her tone and demeanor are completely different from what you witnessed at the Primal Shrine. Is she really Gorgonna?","female":"Her tone and demeanor are completely different from what you witnessed at the Primal Shrine. Is she really Gorgonna?","variant_male_record_index":"190988","variant_female_record_index":"190989","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1511419031:0":{"text":"You barely have time to think before she dashes toward Nazrik in three quick strides.","source_cn":"你来不及细想，只见顿三步并作两步地冲到那非面前。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x27B002CED8DB07ED","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You barely have time to think before she dashes toward Nazrik in three quick strides.","female":"You barely have time to think before she dashes toward Nazrik in three quick strides.","variant_male_record_index":"190990","variant_female_record_index":"190991","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1511419032:0":{"text":"Nazrik, don't listen to her lies! She's manipulating us!","source_cn":"那非，别听她胡说！她是在蛊惑我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83B966EF02556260","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1511419033:0":{"text":"But you hesitate... don't you, my dear little lamb?","source_cn":"可他已经动摇了，不是吗？亲爱的小羊羔？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E15E85D2125687D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1511419034:0":{"text":"... I don't believe you. Begone!","source_cn":"……我不相信你说的话。滚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E79250DC7562900","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1511419035:0":{"text":"Hah. Stubborn as ever.","source_cn":"哈啊……还真是死脑筋呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28B0800A74CEF7F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1511419036:0":{"text":"So be it.","source_cn":"那么，只能这样了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C0E316CAA2EC1A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1511419037:0":{"text":"Wildborn warriors, my little pets, prove your loyalty! Drench me in Nazrik's blood!","source_cn":"去吧，雅库伯尔的战士，我可爱的小宠物们！用那非的鲜血，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x708D1C6C66891C3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1511419038:1":{"text":"For Gorgonna! Slay him!","source_cn":"为了露！杀了那非——！","status":"match